{"4108600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Umbra Survivors", "steam_appid": 4108600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Umbra Survivors</strong> is a <strong>3D Gothic survivors-like</strong>: thousands of enemies, one survivor, automatic attacks, and level-ups that truly change your run. <br>Fight through endless hordes, collect experience, roll rare card upgrades, and forge <strong>synergies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And deep inside the castle, <strong>Lord Umbriel</strong> is already waiting for your visit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thousands Of Enemies, No Downtime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/22bf9543a72a0a020a1e35a81cb50f0d.poster.avif?t=1788289151\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/22bf9543a72a0a020a1e35a81cb50f0d.webm?t=1788289151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/22bf9543a72a0a020a1e35a81cb50f0d.mp4?t=1788289151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hordes grow denser, faster, and more dangerous. Your weapons attack automatically, but survival depends on movement, positioning, and the powers you collect during the run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rare Cards. Brutal Combos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/18cee8b389deafc5e87d7086e06bd879.poster.avif?t=1788289151\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/18cee8b389deafc5e87d7086e06bd879.webm?t=1788289151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/18cee8b389deafc5e87d7086e06bd879.mp4?t=1788289151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every level-up, you choose cards: new weapons, stronger attacks, passive bonuses, or cursed artifacts. Rarities create clear power spikes and runs that develop differently every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make Runs Escalate</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/f0de69a1bae24945025e994d75ddf218.poster.avif?t=1788289151\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/f0de69a1bae24945025e994d75ddf218.webm?t=1788289151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/f0de69a1bae24945025e994d75ddf218.mp4?t=1788289151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine effects, stack bonuses, and find synergies that turn a weak start into an overwhelming run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Epic Boss Fights</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/6f42cafbd887ef70508f23a9c0188980.poster.avif?t=1788289151\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/6f42cafbd887ef70508f23a9c0188980.webm?t=1788289151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/6f42cafbd887ef70508f23a9c0188980.mp4?t=1788289151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the hordes are no longer enough, Lord Umbriel sends his strongest servants after you. Learn attack patterns and keep moving to break massive bosses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playable Characters</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/1b34a8beb894e6e44aeccd165e6af28d.poster.avif?t=1788289151\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/1b34a8beb894e6e44aeccd165e6af28d.webm?t=1788289151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/1b34a8beb894e6e44aeccd165e6af28d.mp4?t=1788289151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock multiple characters, each with their own strengths. A new character can make the same run play completely differently.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Gothic survivors-like / action roguelike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of enemies and endless hordes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic attacks with a focus on movement and build decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card-based level-ups with rarities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal events</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One survivor. Thousands of shadows. No mercy.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Umbra Survivors</strong> is a <strong>3D Gothic survivors-like</strong>: thousands of enemies, one survivor, automatic attacks, and level-ups that truly change your run. <br>Fight through endless hordes, collect experience, roll rare card upgrades, and forge <strong>synergies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And deep inside the castle, <strong>Lord Umbriel</strong> is already waiting for your visit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thousands Of Enemies, No Downtime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/22bf9543a72a0a020a1e35a81cb50f0d.poster.avif?t=1788289151\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/22bf9543a72a0a020a1e35a81cb50f0d.webm?t=1788289151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/22bf9543a72a0a020a1e35a81cb50f0d.mp4?t=1788289151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hordes grow denser, faster, and more dangerous. Your weapons attack automatically, but survival depends on movement, positioning, and the powers you collect during the run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rare Cards. Brutal Combos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/18cee8b389deafc5e87d7086e06bd879.poster.avif?t=1788289151\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/18cee8b389deafc5e87d7086e06bd879.webm?t=1788289151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/18cee8b389deafc5e87d7086e06bd879.mp4?t=1788289151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every level-up, you choose cards: new weapons, stronger attacks, passive bonuses, or cursed artifacts. Rarities create clear power spikes and runs that develop differently every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make Runs Escalate</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/f0de69a1bae24945025e994d75ddf218.poster.avif?t=1788289151\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/f0de69a1bae24945025e994d75ddf218.webm?t=1788289151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/f0de69a1bae24945025e994d75ddf218.mp4?t=1788289151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine effects, stack bonuses, and find synergies that turn a weak start into an overwhelming run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Epic Boss Fights</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/6f42cafbd887ef70508f23a9c0188980.poster.avif?t=1788289151\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/6f42cafbd887ef70508f23a9c0188980.webm?t=1788289151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/6f42cafbd887ef70508f23a9c0188980.mp4?t=1788289151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the hordes are no longer enough, Lord Umbriel sends his strongest servants after you. Learn attack patterns and keep moving to break massive bosses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playable Characters</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/1b34a8beb894e6e44aeccd165e6af28d.poster.avif?t=1788289151\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/1b34a8beb894e6e44aeccd165e6af28d.webm?t=1788289151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108600/extras/1b34a8beb894e6e44aeccd165e6af28d.mp4?t=1788289151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock multiple characters, each with their own strengths. A new character can make the same run play completely differently.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Gothic survivors-like / action roguelike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of enemies and endless hordes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic attacks with a focus on movement and build decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card-based level-ups with rarities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal events</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One survivor. Thousands of shadows. No mercy.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Umbra Survivors is a dark 3D gothic survivors-like: fight through thousands of creatures, draft rare card upgrades, and forge devastating synergies before the next wave swallows you. Multiple heroes, brutal bosses, and every level-up can twist the run.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Thai<br><strong>*</strong>langua